### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### 2. Get All Records (empty initially)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/records

### 3. Create Income Record
POST http://localhost:3000/api/records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-02-27",
  "category": "Salary",
  "description": "Monthly salary",
  "amount": 5000,
  "type": "income"
}

### 4. Create Expense Record
POST http://localhost:3000/api/records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-02-27",
  "category": "Food",
  "description": "Groceries",
  "amount": 500,
  "type": "expense"
}

### 5. Get All Records
GET http://localhost:3000/api/records

### 6. Get Single Record (ID 1)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/records/1

### 7. Update Record
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/records/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5500,
  "description": "Monthly salary + bonus"
}

### 8. Filter Daily
GET http://localhost:3000/api/records/filter/query?period=daily

### 9. Filter Weekly
GET http://localhost:3000/api/records/filter/query?period=weekly

### 10. Filter by Type (Income only)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/records/filter/query?period=daily&type=income

### 11. Get Summary
GET http://localhost:3000/api/records/summary/stats

### 12. Delete Record (ID 1)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/records/1